<p>Bhaiya Zainab aayi hai<br />
shaam se chut ke aayi hai<br />
chehlum karne aayi hai</p>

<p>1) ghazi uth kar dekh tou lo,<br />
behna ki tum halat ko,<br />
dagh rasan k layi hai</p>

<p>
2) kunchao baazar gayi,<br />
mai to zaleelo qaar gayi<br />
Qismat me ruswayi hai</p>

<p>
3) kaise kahu bimar ka haal,<br />
shaam me tha jo isteqbal<br />
Sadme dil pa uthaayi hai</p>

<p>
4) Thi jo sakina khasta jigar,<br />
shaam ke zinda'n me khoo kar<br />
bhayya behan ye aayi hai</p>

<p>
5) maa ki lahed par jaungi,<br />
nile rasan dikhlaaungi<br />
kya kya ranj uthayi hai</p>

<p>
6) jaber ne roro ke kaha,<br />
aaye lahad par jab moula,<br />
ghamgee'n saari khudai hai</p>

<p>
7) ghum me karo mil kar matam,<br />
Naaserane Aza paiham,<br />
Jab ye noha sunayi hai</p>

<p>
8) aye hyder ba aaho buka,<br />
tu ne likha jo ye nouha<br />
girya saari khudayi hai</p>